--- !u!114 &158212705
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 158212704}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: be675e165741483eb6ff89f1383c26a7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  timeScale: 5
  narrations:
  - content: The Princess Frog lets out a final wail as it dissolves into purple
      sludge. The controlled scouts collapse, unconscious but still alive.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: In the center of the crater, the monstrous, purple form of Ives sways.
      The cold rushing back as the adrenaline fades.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: She crashes into the snow.
    manualDuration: 3
    speaker: 0
    signal: ivescrashes
  - content: IVES!
    manualDuration: 2
    speaker: 1
    signal: 
  - content: Jackie presses her fingers to Ives neck, checking for a pulse.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: ...Jackie?
    manualDuration: 2
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: I'm here! Just... hold on. We have to get you back to Kade.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 1
    signal: 
  - content: I can't move my legs, kid.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: The world is... spinning.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: I got you. I can carry you back. Just please, please hang on!
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 1
    signal: 
  - content: 'Hah... '
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: ...Sorry, kid.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: "I can\u2019t be making any more promises I can\u2019t keep."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: jackiesorry
  - content: "Ives, I\u2019m so sor-"
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 1
    signal: 
  - content: Jackie freezes. A familiar feeling rises up her throat, threatening
      to burst from her chest.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: 
    manualDuration: 15
    speaker: 0
    signal: hacky way to give some time for flashbacks
  - content: 'The apology stops burning in her throat. '
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: apologystops
  - content: '...But how... '
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 1
    signal: 
  - content: "The one thing I can promise you\u2026 is that I will always be so proud
      of you. Even if I\u2019m not here."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: "Because I know you\u2019re constantly changing for the better."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: "And because I\u2019m so proud of you right now."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: You found out what happened to your mother, and you defeated that Frog.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: But I never did that alone... Cam... You were with me. Without you...
      what am I going to...
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 1
    signal: 
  - content: "There will always be more people like me. But you\u2019ll never find
      them, if you don\u2019t open your heart\u2026 and let them in.\r\n"
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: " I\u2019ll try\u2026 I\u2026 wish I saw it sooner. What you all were
      doing for me. So I could do the same for you."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: ...
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: "I get it... you feel like a fraud... Like you\u2019re never doing enough
      for the people around you. \r\n"
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: You wonder why you get so much, when you can offer so little.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 2
    signal: 
  - content: "You may not feel like you\u2019ve done a lot for me, but that's where
      you\u2019re wrong."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: 'Raising you was the best thing that ever happened to me. '
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: You could never be a burden, kid.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: "When Ailin left me behind, I thought it was because I wasn\u2019t enough
      of a soldier. "
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: "But I realized that... she didn\u2019t need a soldier. She needed...
      a friend, for me and for you to have a family."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: You gave me purpose, kid. You made me realize... you don't have to save
      the world to be enough for someone. Sometimes you just have to be there.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: And you were always there for me.
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: ...
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: "You can\u2019t ever know what being enough is for someone else. So
      all you can do is be there for them..."
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
  - content: Can you promise me that?
    manualDuration: 0
    speaker: 0
    signal: 
